OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785327526
OL,3,CMourners asked to wear football
OL,4,Cclothing after mum killed at level
OL,5,Ccrossing
OL,7,FThe funeral service will take place
OL,8,Flater for a mum who was killed when a
OL,9,Ftrain struck her car on a level
OL,10,Fcrossing.
OL,12,FThe family of 33-year-old Kerry
OL,13,FCoombes say she was a "devoted mum"
OL,14,Fwho "had the biggest heart".
OL,16,FKerry died after the collision on
OL,17,FStation Road in Hoghton, Lancashire,
OL,18,Fon 25 June at 08:50 BST.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
