PN,36902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785327526
OL,3,CMourners asked to wear football
OL,4,Cclothing after mum killed at level
OL,5,Ccrossing
OL,7,FHer funeral will be held at The Parish
OL,8,FChurch of All Saints' Higher Walton at
OL,9,F11am.
OL,11,FKerry's Mum, Karen Battye-Coombes, has
OL,12,Fthanked everyone for their kind
OL,13,Fmessages in memory of her daughter.
OL,15,FMourners have been asked to wear
OL,16,Ffootball-related clothing for the
OL,17,Fservice.
OL,19,FThe funeral car will be travelling
OL,20,Ffrom Hoghton along Gregson Lane.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785327526
OL,3,CMourners asked to wear football
OL,4,Cclothing after mum killed at level
OL,5,Ccrossing
OL,7,FPaying tribute the family said she was
OL,8,F"beautiful inside and out".
OL,10,F"She was kind, generous and full of
OL,11,Flife," they said.
OL,13,FShe was a football coach who loved the
OL,14,Fgame and "lived for her children and
OL,15,Fher family".
OL,17,FLostock Hall Juniors Football Club say
OL,18,Fthey are coming together to celebrate
OL,19,Fthe life of their dear friend,
OL,20,Fcommittee member and team coach.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
