OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785327526
OL,3,CMourners asked to wear football
OL,4,Cclothing after mum killed at level
OL,5,Ccrossing
OL,7,FVolunteers say she was an amazing mum,
OL,8,Fdaughter, sister, fiancee and a role
OL,9,Fmodel to many children and young
OL,10,Fpeople for over 14 years.
OL,12,FKerry's 8 year old daughter was
OL,13,Fseriously injured in the accident.
OL,15,FEvidence suggests the crossing's
OL,16,Flights and warning alarm in Hoghton
OL,17,Fnear Preston had not activated - and
OL,18,Fbarriers were still raised.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
