PN,36905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785327526
OL,3,CMourners asked to wear football
OL,4,Cclothing after mum killed at level
OL,5,Ccrossing
OL,7,FThe Rail Accident Investigation Branch
OL,8,Fsaid preliminary evidence suggests
OL,9,Fwarning systems did not activate as
OL,10,Fthe train approached.
OL,12,FNetwork Rail said it was "fully
OL,13,Fcooperating" with the investigation.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
